The files in this directory are part of turboword and are licensed like the project:
MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE at the repository root).

- record-libreoffice.mjs: the recorder script, written for turboword.
- corpus.json, libreoffice.json: data generated by that script from the .docx fixtures in the
  sibling directories (file names, content hashes, page counts and hashes of text rows). No
  document content is copied here; each source document stays under the licence listed in its
  own directory's LICENSE file (see also test/fixtures/SOURCES.md).
